  "text": "Recipe: Yum Cha\nCreator: Frank Lee\nIngredients: mushroom, tofu, tamari, pomegranate molasses, nutritional yeast, black salt, pepper, kale, flaxseed meal egg replacer, cornmeal, sriracha, vinegar, various herbs & spices\nCooking methods: blend, steam\nInstructions: Blend mushroom and tofu into paste. Season with tamari, pomegranate molasses, nutritional yeast, black salt & pepper. Mix finely chopped kale into the paste. Add flaxseed meal egg replacer to paste. Squeeze and form balls. Dust with cornmeal. Steam for 10 mins. Serve with homemade sriracha, tamari & vinegar.\nNotes: A recipe with MUSHROOMS, BEANS (tofu), NUTS & SEEDS (flaxseed), SWEETENER (pomegranate molasses), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
